# The main menu's Quit, under Play a Show (Rock Band 3 Deluxe) or Music Store
# (the game as it shipped). Deluxe makes it, as Exit Game, when its scripts see
# MHX_PC, which band3 defines; on a game without it band3 makes its own
# (src/Hooks/quit_button.cpp). Either way it's the main menu's sixth button and
# its confirm screen is confirm_exit_game_screen, with Quit (or Exit Game) on
# top and Keep Rockin' under it. Starts on the main menu (main_hub_screen), with
# player 1 joined, the cursor on Play Now and no menu open. Ends by quitting:
# band3 then closes by itself, so look for "Game requested exit" at the end of
# its log.

# down to Quit; it asks first, and Keep Rockin' goes back
press down
sleep 300ms
press down
sleep 300ms
press down
sleep 300ms
press down
sleep 300ms
press down
sleep 600ms
press green until screen=confirm_exit_game_screen timeout=10s
sleep 1500ms
screenshot quit-confirm
press down
sleep 500ms
press green until screen=main_hub_screen timeout=10s
sleep 1s

# hidden in Play Now's choices, there again on the main menu
press up
sleep 300ms
press up
sleep 300ms
press up
sleep 300ms
press up
sleep 300ms
press up
sleep 600ms
press green
sleep 2s
screenshot quit-hidden-in-play-now
press red
sleep 2s
screenshot quit-main-menu

# and quits
press down
sleep 300ms
press down
sleep 300ms
press down
sleep 300ms
press down
sleep 300ms
press down
sleep 600ms
press green until screen=confirm_exit_game_screen timeout=10s
sleep 1500ms
press green
